  "notable_quotes": [
    "TGA mass losses from 420-800 °C for NTOU-4 and 390-800 °C for NTOU-4a are lower than calculated, likely because PIII oxidizes to PV during decomposition.",
    "NTOU-4 retains structural integrity up to 400 °C in air, while NTOU-4a remains intact only up to 350 °C, showing the Zn framework is more thermally stable than the Co analogue.",
    "NTOU-4 selectively removes, recovers, and turn-on senses toxic Hg2+ in water, while no adsorption is observed for Cr3+, Cd2+, Na+, or Cs+."
